data_MPFL
# Synthetic: metal links whose only partner the depositor's flags place. Zinc
# is joined only to an ATP marked NO FUNCTIONAL ROLE, which is left out, so the
# zinc counts as unlinked: a ligand to confirm. Magnesium is joined only to a
# glycerol marked SUBJECT OF INVESTIGATION, which is kept, so the magnesium is
# a cofactor.
_entry.id MPFL
#
